  "data": {
    "ruleType": "core-ability",
    "group": "Core",
    "summary": "Models in a unit that has this ability may take Normal moves, Fall Back moves and Advance moves across models without TITANIC. Its models can go sideways through terrain sections at most 4″ high. Before starting, you can give each model MOBILE until movement finishes. If you chose that option, roll a D6 afterward. A 1 Battle-shocks the unit. The MOBILE option lets the unit cross dense terrain horizontally. See **[Super-heavy Walker](vsdata:core-rule/super-heavy-walker)** and **[Terrain and Movement](vsdata:core-rule/terrain-and-movement)**.",
